@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Customer
actor Agent
actor Admin
actor Underwriter
participant "Angular 21" as UI
participant "Ocelot" as GW
participant "IdentityService" as ID
participant "CustomerVehicleService" as CV
participant "QuoteRatingService" as QR
participant "UnderwritingService" as UW
participant "PolicyBillingService" as PB
participant "ClaimsService" as CL

Customer -> UI : Register
UI -> GW : POST /identity/api/auth/register
GW -> ID : Register Customer
ID --> GW : Registered
GW --> UI : Registration result

Customer -> UI : Complete profile
UI -> GW : Customer profile API
GW -> CV : Create/update profile
CV --> GW : Profile complete
GW --> UI : Profile complete

Admin -> UI : Assign Customer to Agent
UI -> GW : POST /customer-vehicle/api/admin/customers/{id}/agent
GW -> CV : Assign once
CV --> GW : Assigned
GW --> UI : Assigned

Agent -> UI : Create Driver + Vehicle
UI -> GW : Driver/Vehicle APIs
GW -> CV : Persist risk data
CV --> GW : Ready for quote
GW --> UI : Ready

Agent -> UI : Generate / configure / finalize Quote
UI -> GW : Quote APIs
GW -> QR : Quote lifecycle
QR -> CV : Risk contract
CV --> QR : Risk data
QR -> CL : Claim history contract
CL --> QR : Qualifying count
QR --> GW : Finalized immutable Quote
GW --> UI : Quote finalized

Agent -> UI : Submit Quote for underwriting
UI -> GW : POST /quotes/api/quotes/{id}/submit
GW -> QR : Submit
QR -> UW : POST /internal/underwriting/applications
UW --> QR : Application created
QR --> GW : Submitted
GW --> UI : Underwriting created

Admin -> UI : Assign Underwriter
UI -> GW : POST /underwriting/api/admin/underwriting/{id}/assign
GW -> UW : Assign once
UW --> GW : Assigned
GW --> UI : Assigned

Underwriter -> UI : Review + approve
UI -> GW : Underwriting review / decision APIs
GW -> UW : Complete review + approve
UW --> GW : Approved + 7-day deadline
GW --> UI : Approved offer

Customer -> UI : Accept offer + choose effective date/frequency
UI -> GW : Policy purchase configure/accept
GW -> PB : Validate approved offer
PB -> UW : Approved offer contract
UW --> PB : Valid
PB --> GW : Payment required
GW --> UI : Payment
Customer -> UI : First payment
UI -> GW : POST /policies/api/purchases/{id}/payments
GW -> PB : Simulated payment + atomic issuance
PB --> GW : Policy issued + PDF metadata
GW --> UI : Policy issued

== Claims lifecycle ==
Agent -> UI : Create FNOL + Claim + evidence
UI -> GW : Claims APIs
GW -> CL : Create/submit claim
CL -> PB : Resolve historical coverage
PB --> CL : Policy term + coverage
CL --> GW : Submitted claim
GW --> UI : Submitted
Admin -> UI : Assign Claims Adjuster
UI -> GW : Assign endpoint
GW -> CL : Assign once
CL --> GW : Assigned
GW --> UI : Assigned
Underwriter -> UI : (No underwriting role here)

actor "Claims Adjuster" as Adjuster
Adjuster -> UI : Review + assess + decide
UI -> GW : Adjuster review/decision APIs
GW -> CL : Review + decision
CL -> PB : Historical coverage contract
PB --> CL : Limit + deductible
CL --> GW : Settlement
GW --> UI : Settlement

alt Above Adjuster authority
  Admin -> UI : Approve/reject exact settlement
  UI -> GW : Admin settlement decision
  GW -> CL : Authority decision
end

Customer -> UI : Accept settlement + choose payout
UI -> GW : Settlement acceptance + payout
GW -> CL : Simulate payout
CL --> GW : Paid / Failed
GW --> UI : Payout result / claim closed when Paid
@enduml
